@host = http://localhost:5080
@apiKey = demo-key
@recipient = user@example.com

### 1. Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### 2. Send from Assessment system
POST {{host}}/api/v1/email/send
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateKey": "AssessmentBooked",
  "to": [{ "email": "{{recipient}}", "name": "Jane Example" }],
  "data": {
    "candidate": { "id": "C-10045", "name": "Jane Example" },
    "assessment": { "type": "Capability Assessment", "status": "Booked" },
    "session": { "date": "Monday, 25 August 2026", "location": { "name": "Melbourne" } }
  },
  "sourceSystem": "Assessment",
  "correlationId": "meeting-demo-001"
}

### 3. Send from Accreditation system (same endpoint!)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/email/send
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateKey": "Welcome",
  "to": [{ "email": "{{recipient}}", "name": "Jane Example" }],
  "data": { "candidateName": "Jane Example", "portal": "Accreditation" },
  "sourceSystem": "Accreditation",
  "correlationId": "meeting-demo-002"
}

### 4. Send from Power Automate (same endpoint!)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/email/send
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateKey": "AssessmentBooked",
  "to": [{ "email": "{{recipient}}", "name": "John Doe" }],
  "data": { "candidateName": "John Doe", "action": "Reminder" },
  "sourceSystem": "PowerAutomate",
  "correlationId": "meeting-demo-003"
}

### 5. Unified audit search (all systems)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/activity?search={{recipient}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 6. Filter by source system
GET {{host}}/api/v1/activity?source=Assessment
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 7. Browse templates
GET {{host}}/api/v1/templates
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 8. Unauthorized request (no API key)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/email/send
Content-Type: application/json

{ "templateKey": "Test", "to": [{"email": "{{recipient}}"}], "data": {}, "sourceSystem": "unknown" }

### 9. Simulate Mandrill webhook
POST {{host}}/api/v1/events/mandrill
Content-Type: application/json

[{ "event": "delivered", "email": "{{recipient}}", "_id": "mandrill-001" }]
